  "summary": "盘二十四武贪丑命火星同踞，作者反对见此组合就一概吉。戊己生年或戊己干大限下的贪狼或武曲化禄、壬癸生年或壬癸干大限下的武曲或贪狼化忌，涉及备选对象，不按常识补天干对应。吉化时火贪可成格；忌化时相克与寡宿凶象加重，但多吉可缓和。来源组合与OR保留，后图不重构。",
  "summary_en": "Chart Twenty-Four has Military Melody and Greedy Wolf in Chou Life with Fire Star. The author rejects automatic favorable judgment. Wu/Ji births or corresponding stem cycles involve Greedy Wolf OR Military Melody Prosperity, whereas Ren/Gui births or cycles involve Military Melody OR Greedy Wolf Obstruction. No unstated stem-to-star mapping is supplied. Favorable transformation can form Huo Tan; adverse transformation intensifies elemental conflict and Gua Su effects, subject to mitigation by many benefics. The named alternatives remain unresolved structured objects, and the mixed chart is not reconstructed.",
